                    "text": "<p><em>We are very blessed to meet coach 阿哲 (Ah Zhe), who patiently taught my 2 young kids how to ski. The instructions on meet up location and rental of ski equipment were precise and simple. Coach 阿哲 is very good with kids and makes a lot of small talk to get us comfortable seeing that it's our first time skiing. Would definitely recommend coach and will look for coach when we are next back for skiing! 我們很幸運地遇到了阿哲教練，他耐心地教我的兩個孩子滑雪。關於集合地點和滑雪設備租賃的說明準確而簡單。阿哲教練對孩子們很好，和我們開聊了很多，讓我們感到很舒服，因為這是我們第一次滑雪。肯定會推薦教練，並且當我們下次回來滑雪時會尋找教練！</em></p>",
